/* 简体中文。术语跟着大陆惯用叫法走（转录稿／麦克风／系统设置），不是繁体的字面转换。 */

/* Scenario */
"Discussion" = "讨论会议";
"Fills in background on the tools, terms and numbers people mention, and flags claims worth checking." = "补上被提到的工具、术语、数字的背景资料，标出值得核实的说法。";
"Interview" = "面试";
"Judges whether the candidate's answers are correct or vague, and suggests what to press on next." = "判断受访者的回答是否正确、哪里含糊，并建议接下来该追问什么。";

/* Speakers */
"Speaker %lld" = "说话人 %lld";

/* Markdown export */
"# Meeting Transcript" = "# 会议转录稿";
"[%1$@] %2$@: %3$@" = "[%1$@] %2$@：%3$@";
"[%1$@] %2$@" = "[%1$@] %2$@";

/* Audio capture */
"No display found. ScreenCaptureKit audio capture has to be bound to a display or window." = "找不到 display，ScreenCaptureKit 音频采集必须绑定一个 display/window";
"System audio capture failed: %@. On first run you have to grant access in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Screen & System Audio Recording." = "系统音频采集失败：%@。第一次跑要在「系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 屏幕与系统音频录制」里授权。";
"System audio capture stopped: %@" = "系统音频采集中断：%@";
"Could not build a %lld Hz mono audio converter" = "建不出 %lld Hz mono 的音频转换器";
"Microphone failed to start: %@" = "麦克风启动失败：%@";

